   "widgets_values": [
    "subject_definitions:\n<Video 1> is the source video for the target video edit.\n<Subject 1> is the woman in <Picture 1>, <Picture 2>, <Picture 3>, <Picture 4> and <Picture 5>, a white woman in her mid-twenties with dark brown, wavy, shoulder-length hair.\n<Audio 1> is the synchronized audio track of <Video 1> and is reused in the target video.\n\nsummary:\n[video editing + audio reuse] The target video is an edited version of <Video 1> in which <Subject 1>'s sweater is bright red instead of dark green; everything else stays as it is in <Video 1>.\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Video 1> (source video): partially_preserved - the shot, framing, camera movement, setting, light and <Subject 1>'s movements are kept; only the colour of her sweater differs.\n<Subject 1> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - her facial identity, hairstyle and build are retained.\n<Audio 1>: fully_copy - the audio of <Video 1>, its dialogue and sounds, is reused unchanged.\n\ndetailed_description:\nThe target video is <Video 1> as edited; the source shot, with the change, is as follows.\nThe target video uses a realistic, live-action cinematic style. It is evening.\n[Shot 1] A POV shot from the viewer's eye level; the viewer is never visible. A medium shot shows <Subject 1> (S1), a white woman in her mid-twenties with dark brown, wavy, shoulder-length hair, wearing a bright red wool sweater, standing in the center of the room, holding the lantern at waist height. The place is the reading room, and a lantern is present. The weather is calm. The reading room, a vast vault of white salt and paper. <Subject 1> tilts her head slightly as she listens. <Subject 1> (S1), using the warm, low, calm timbre referenced from <Audio 1>, says in a steady, even tone, <d>[English] It is the Salt Archive. Every word here is preserved by the sea.</d> <Subject 1> takes a step forward, the lantern light dancing across the shelves. The camera pushes in with small amplitude at slow speed toward her face.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nThe faint crunch of salt underfoot. A distant, heavy drip echoes.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nA low, steady hum of strings.",
    608,
    352,
    158,
    "match"
   ],
   "title": "Edit (<Video 1> = the clip, <Audio 1> = its soundtrack)"
  },
